        "title": "Expert Backed Review Summary",
        "text": "<p>Nutricost Casein Protein Powder offers a straightforward approach to slow-release protein supplementation. Each serving provides 25 grams of micellar casein protein, a complete dairy-derived protein that digests gradually over several hours, making it particularly popular before bedtime or during extended periods between meals. The formula is gluten-free, non-GMO, and manufactured in a GMP-compliant, FDA-registered facility. With approximately 71 servings in the 5-pound container, it delivers strong value compared to many premium competitors. Users frequently praise its affordability, versatility, and ability to promote fullness, with many incorporating it into overnight oats, smoothies, and baking recipes. The thick texture characteristic of casein protein is often viewed positively because it creates a more satisfying shake. However, this same quality can be a drawback for others, as some users find it overly dense, chalky, or difficult to mix without extra liquid or a blender. Opinions on the vanilla flavor are similarly divided, with some appreciating its mild sweetness while others describe it as artificial or less enjoyable than competing brands.</p>",
